{"v":4,"catch":"2D物理的混亂狀態！","desc":"Robozarro是一款基於物理的2D動作遊戲，其中機器人B0-3和0-Ramatron進行了一次史詩般的探索，穿越了Mech Angeles的郊區，最陰暗面和屋頂，以探索有關Zarro博士失踪的謎團。\n\n特色：\n\n• 使用動態的2D物理引擎，在生活中探索不可預測的世界。\n• 掌握“ Grab N Blast”物理操縱工具，將周圍環境變成爆炸性武器！\n• 冒險時收集垃圾，以此交易健康，武器或升級。\n• 獨特恢復的小工具，以幫助您穿越Mech Angeles的旅程。\n• 把計時賽解鎖，並嘗試在沒有檢查點的情況下突破等級或遭受零傷害！","publisher":"eastasiasoft","release":"2020-07-09","genres":["動作","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.2GB / Switch 1.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/49f802c200b52d512fd34142484aef0f51bcbc547722227d187f570d1a6b8485.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bc0bda0f88a7bd430a1504edb202efa95e19698307379f0966eda184fc49e0ce.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b97ed491bf312fd88d6896cae1900f987f2fb5e04bfc4db0989b15307950df95.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/92e625d2be4353bc2eeaeb4671a4a54bbe915895842030a2f7178403cd079a82.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c74c2f8a682d6e535dd11c4483cb82bdb93eb05b8628896dd0e8209e5722c3c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d1f94b3bced55064a1d28816ceedcb160c0e3bf17a540f50116ae8d185bbd4e1.jpg"],"titleId":"010044a010bb8000","dlc":[]}